DFO Rust Shell
==============

An experimental, unofficial desktop shell for DFO Online.

Upstream
--------

DFO Online (https://github.com/Lattymoy/daggerfall-js-source) is MIT-licensed,
Copyright (c) Lattymoy and contributors, and includes Daggerfall Unity's notice
(MIT, Copyright (c) Interkarma and contributors). This repository contains no
game code, no game data and no game assets: it reads a build and an ARENA2
folder that the player already has.

Attribution
-----------

src/store.rs is a Rust translation of the storage rules in DFO Online's
app/lib/fileStorage.cjs (MIT, Copyright (c) Lattymoy and contributors): the
file layout, the pref-name encoding and the screenshot translation are theirs;
the translation is ours.

