Proof of concept
----------------

This is an experiment, not a supported product. It writes to the real
"Daggerfall JavaScript" Prefs/ and Saves/ folders under your user data
directory. Back them up before running it. It is not for online play. No
warranty of any kind; the authors are not liable for lost saves, settings, data
or anything else.
